<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak cbank forex reserves firm to $3.02 bln.</title>
<headline>Slovak cbank forex reserves firm to $3.02 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Friday its hard currency reserves totalled $3.018 billion as of June 25, up from $2.966 billion on June 18.  </p>
<p>  SLOVAK FOREX RESERVES    June 25   June 18   Dec 31/96</p>
<p>   NBS reserves ($bln)	3.018     2.966	3.473</p>
<p>   Commercial banks	   2.158     2.197	2.321</p>
<p>   Entire banking sector    5.176     5.163	5.794</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
